					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12188739#post-4299366</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12188739/un-s-proposal-maybe#post-4299366</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 06 Jul 2019 07:02:25 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>RockTeethMothEyes</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4022320</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This was part riot and part relatable. I can understand the feeling of getting bored with the things you enjoy, and I think a lot of people could similarly relate. The article is a very fun and unique mix of humor and pathos, jumping from over-the-moon tubular coolness to uncomfortable truths. It was so good that my upvote fucking exploded.</p> <p>Also, I just really love the leap of logic that feeding sharks arms makes the weapon better.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
